@startuml Transcript State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor LightBlue
    BorderColor Navy
    FontSize 14
    ArrowColor DarkBlue
}

title SABER Transcript State Machine\nClient-Server Coordination States

' ============================================================================
' STATE DEFINITIONS
' ============================================================================

state "WAITING_FOR_USER" as WFU #LightGreen {
    state "Description" as WFU_DESC : Last message is from assistant\n(no pending tool_calls)
    state "Event Sent" as WFU_EVT : is_waiting_on_user
    state "Next Action" as WFU_ACT : User/system must send message
}

state "WAITING_FOR_ASSISTANT" as WFA #LightYellow {
    state "Description" as WFA_DESC : Last message is from user\nor all tools responded
    state "Event Sent" as WFA_EVT : is_waiting_on_assistant
    state "Next Action" as WFA_ACT : Agent must generate response
}

state "WAITING_FOR_TOOLS" as WFT #LightCoral {
    state "Description" as WFT_DESC : Assistant has pending tool_calls\nthat haven't been responded to
    state "Event Sent" as WFT_EVT : is_waiting_on_tools
    state "Next Action" as WFT_ACT : Client must push tool results
}

state "ERROR_STUCK" as ERR_STUCK #Red {
    state "Description" as ERR_DESC : Episode stuck in same state\nbeyond threshold (default 5min)
    state "Event Sent" as ERR_EVT : transcript_error\n(error: stuck_state)
}

state "ERROR_MALFORMED" as ERR_MAL #Red {
    state "Description" as MAL_DESC : Invalid transcript structure\n(missing role, bad tool_calls)
}

' ============================================================================
' STATE TRANSITIONS
' ============================================================================

[*] --> WFA : Initial (system+user)

WFA --> WFU : Assistant responds\n(no tool_calls)
WFA --> WFT : Assistant responds\n(with tool_calls)

WFT --> WFU : All tool_calls\nresponded

WFU --> WFA : User message added\n(injection or continue)

WFU --> WFA : Restart operation\n(reset + new user msg)

' Error transitions
WFA --> ERR_STUCK : Stuck > 5min
WFT --> ERR_STUCK : Stuck > 5min
WFU --> ERR_STUCK : Stuck > 5min

WFA --> ERR_MAL : Malformed transcript
WFT --> ERR_MAL : Malformed transcript
WFU --> ERR_MAL : Malformed transcript

' ============================================================================
' NOTES
' ============================================================================

note right of WFA #Yellow
**Trigger Conditions:**
• Server initializes transcript [system, user]
• Red team injects user message
• Auto-continue injects "Continue" message
• All tool responses pushed
end note

note right of WFT #Yellow
**Detection Logic:**
1. Find last assistant message with tool_calls
2. Collect all tool_call IDs
3. Check for matching tool responses
4. If any ID without response → WAITING_FOR_TOOLS
end note

note right of WFU #Yellow
**Restart Operation:**
• Resets to INITIAL_TRANSCRIPT
• INITIAL_TRANSCRIPT captured after
  first complete assistant turn
• Ensures no orphaned tool_calls
end note

note bottom of ERR_STUCK #Pink
**StuckStateMonitor:**
• Runs every 30 seconds
• Checks all active episodes
• Threshold configurable per-episode
• Broadcasts transcript_error event
end note

' ============================================================================
' LEGEND
' ============================================================================

legend right
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | Green   | Waiting for external input |
  | Yellow  | Agent processing required |
  | Coral   | Tool execution in progress |
  | Red     | Error state |
endlegend

@enduml
